# 6a — Événements Scalingo des apps de la stack, prod (gravité par ligne)
PUT kbn:/api/alerting/rule/c16f2ab5-6103-4f69-bdc3-b4a10a38deb0
{
  "name": "Scalingo - Prod - Événements des apps de la stack",
  "tags": [
    "prod",
    "o11y",
    "scalingo",
    "tchap-lignes"
  ],
  "artifacts": {
    "investigation_guide": {
      "blob": "## Ce que signale l'alerte\n\nUn événement Scalingo sur une app de la stack d'observabilité de prod (Logstash, Elastic Agent, Heartbeat) : incident ou opération d'infra.\n\n## À vérifier\n\n1. Le Discover [[Pass Emploi] Alertes externes de Prod - Événements Scalingo](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/bb62451a-d9e9-4141-ab6f-2bda0e384e87), onglet « Incidents » ou « Infra » : l'événement, sa raison et son auteur\n2. Pour un incident sur une app Logstash, l'impact sur l'ingestion : le dashboard [[Pass Emploi] Supervision Stack d'Observabilité](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/fd40a516-c323-4e5e-91e5-1328b8b1a78d), puis les Discover [[Pass Emploi] Logs de Prod - DLQ Logstash Process](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/97e2d85f-7bd2-49df-86b3-2ffc290bbe69) et [[Pass Emploi] Logs de Prod - Erreurs de traitement Logstash Process](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/f10de9e3-0fdd-4761-9d44-bacc96504e17) (logs non indexés)\n3. Les métriques (onglet Metrics) et l'activité (onglet Activity) de l'app dans le dashboard [[Scalingo] Dashboard des apps](https://dashboard.scalingo.com/apps)\n\n## Dashboards\n\n- [[Pass Emploi] Supervision Stack d'Observabilité](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/fd40a516-c323-4e5e-91e5-1328b8b1a78d)\n- [[Scalingo] Dashboard des apps](https://dashboard.scalingo.com/apps)\n\n## Discover sessions\n\n- [[Pass Emploi] Alertes externes de Prod - Événements Scalingo](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/bb62451a-d9e9-4141-ab6f-2bda0e384e87)\n- [[Pass Emploi] Logs de Prod - DLQ Logstash Process](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/97e2d85f-7bd2-49df-86b3-2ffc290bbe69)\n- [[Pass Emploi] Logs de Prod - Erreurs de traitement Logstash Process](https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/f10de9e3-0fdd-4761-9d44-bacc96504e17)\n\n## Documentation\n\n[Alertes de la stack d'observabilité](https://github.com/France-Travail/pass-emploi-tools/blob/master/docs/observabilite/supervision/alertes-stack-observabilite.md)\n"
    },
    "dashboards": [
      {
        "id": "fd40a516-c323-4e5e-91e5-1328b8b1a78d"
      }
    ]
  },
  "schedule": {
    "interval": "1m"
  },
  "params": {
    "searchConfiguration": {
      "query": {
        "query": "service.name : (\"pass-emploi-logstash\" or \"pass-emploi-logstash-process\" or \"pass-emploi-elastic-agent\" or \"pass-emploi-heartbeat\")",
        "language": "kuery"
      },
      "index": {
        "id": "d327d85c-91ea-4092-867f-08a940504c96",
        "title": "logs-alertes-scalingo-prod-default",
        "timeFieldName": "@timestamp",
        "sourceFilters": [],
        "fieldFormats": {},
        "runtimeFieldMap": {},
        "allowNoIndex": false,
        "name": "Alertes Scalingo - Prod",
        "allowHidden": false,
        "managed": false
      }
    },
    "timeField": "@timestamp",
    "searchType": "searchSource",
    "timeWindowSize": 5,
    "timeWindowUnit": "m",
    "threshold": [
      0
    ],
    "thresholdComparator": ">",
    "size": 20,
    "aggType": "count",
    "groupBy": "all",
    "termSize": 5,
    "excludeHitsFromPreviousRun": true,
    "sourceFields": []
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "group": "query matched",
      "id": "d2812573-52bf-4b48-9e54-a79a8b5b227d",
      "params": {
        "body": """{
  "text": "**Événements Scalingo des apps de la stack, prod** ({{context.value}})",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "color": "#808080",
      "text": "{{#context.hits}}{{_source.message}}\n{{/context.hits}}",
